Description:
{any Holy creature + any Unholy creature}
Once per turn, when you restore HP to a creature or pay PHP: Deal 1 damage to the enemy creature in front of this creature for each fusion splice under it.
Feathers at the shoulder, bat wing at the tips.

{any 2 Noble creatures}
When this creature is destroyed: You may banish a fusion splice from under it. If you do, return it to the field at the start of your next turn with its other fusion splices and its ATK, HP and Speed halved (4 ATK / 11 HP / 1 Speed). If all your lanes are full then, it goes to your Waste Repository.
An ordinary man, raised to heaven by his deeds.

{Nomed The Dark Viscount + Renroc The Dark Marquis}
Once per turn: Pay 3 PHP to destroy a creature with 6 or less HP, or banish a fusion splice from under this creature to destroy a creature with 10 or less HP.
He used to be chill. Then he lost everything.

{Cat + Bunny}
If this creature doesn’t attack: Restore 1 HP to it at end phase.
Your opponent can only attack creatures with the name 'Bunny' or fusions which have splices named 'bunny' while this card is on the field.

{Gob-omber + any Greedy creature}
Once per turn: Pay X gold, or banish a fusion splice from under this creature for X = 4. Deal X damage to an enemy creature and half of X (rounded down) to the creatures in the lanes next to it.
Threaded two mountains with a bomb aboard. He'll tell you about it.
